{"sections":[{"slug":"常值单纯对象","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"常值单纯对象"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">常值单纯对象</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“常值单纯对象”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的常值</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\Delta^{\\text{op}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的常值函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即复合函子</span> $\\underline{c} \\colon \\Delta^{\\text{op}} \\to \\{c\\} \\to\\mathsf C$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">常值单纯对象是</span> $\\operatorname{ev}_0 \\colon \\mathsf C^{\\Delta^{\\text{op}}} \\to\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即有自然同构</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf C^{\\Delta^{\\text{op}}}}(\\underline{c},X) \\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf C}(c,X_0).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">推论</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">常值单纯对象的构造给出了</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathsf C^{\\Delta^{\\text{op}}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的全忠实嵌入</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}